{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"d20cea63-32a9-4cf9-81dd-ec1ac6375ef5":{"type":"background-image-text","settings":{"subtitle":"BLACK FRIDAY COLLECTION","title":"20% OFF on COMMERCIAL ENTRANCE MATS","text":"<p>Save up to 20% on entrance mats in this collection with code <strong>BF20<\/strong> at checkout.<br\/><br\/>Offer ends November 30.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Entrance_Mats_1_03fba5ef-597d-45c7-af09-773ccdd2c74c.jpg","focal_point":"80% 100%","layout":"right","height":450,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"b623c549-86c3-494e-bcd7-0de601be98b5":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Indoor_Outdoor_Entrance_Mats_02536f07-8f2a-487f-85b7-4707dbe0dd7a.jpg","image_width":700,"subtitle":"When there is no room outside","title":"Indoor\/outdoor Mats","text":"<p>The perfect solution for most buildings, these mats use a combination of tough and absorbent fibers. They also work best in building where space for matting is limited.<\/p><p>The tough scraper fibers capture bigger chunks of dirt and debris, while the absorbent fibers work to keep water and other liquids out of your building.<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"SHOP Indoor\/Outdoor Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/black-friday-collection-indoor-outdoor-entrance-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"9d1f35bb-1d6e-4170-97ce-f4bcc004927e":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"Use code BF20 for 20% off indoor & outdoor mats","home_featured_products":"black-friday-collection-indoor-outdoor-entrance-mats","per_row":5,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"26b1c1da-6978-4771-bfa7-8502dd33df30":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Outdoor_Entrance_Mat_17e78a4d-ff60-4978-8c74-b014c0012254.jpg","image_width":700,"subtitle":"For Larger Entrances","title":"OUTDOOR ENTRANCE MATS","text":"<p>For buildings with room outside, these mats do a great job of keeping dirt and debris outside.<\/p><p>Traditionally made out of tougher polypropylene fabric, hardened plastics\/metals, or rubber, these mats are very durable and withstand harsh conditions and high traffic. Since the mats are not made using saturating yarn, they continue to perform well even under heavy rain or snow fall.<\/p><p>Best if combined with an indoor entrance mat to keep water out of the building.<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"SHOP OUTDOOR ENTRANCE MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/black-friday-collection-outdoor-entrance-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"6d95f33c-ef74-41d2-82a3-43c56a84561a":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"Use code BF20 for 20% off outdoor mats","home_featured_products":"black-friday-collection-outdoor-entrance-mats","per_row":5,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"5f480b52-3ee5-4eea-aa68-5cd985a98728":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Indoor_Entrance_Mats_5f54aba8-7ccb-4e94-a497-f5644c407697.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Best to cover walkways","title":"Indoor Entrance Mats","text":"<p>Made out of absorbent material such as nylon, these mats work best when combined with an outdoor mat that scrapes away dust and debris. These indoor mats then take care of any moisture to keep it out of the building.<\/p><p>These indoor mats also work great as runners inside the building, keeping people’s feet of the floors, thus keeping them cleaner throughout the building.<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"Shop Indoor Entrance Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/black-friday-collection-indoor-entrance-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"6f68f7bc-8e39-43a5-b13a-51a5aab2fa46":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"Use code BF20 for 20% off indoor mats","home_featured_products":"black-friday-collection-indoor-entrance-mats","per_row":5,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"5e0671a2-ee7f-497a-87d2-f75507b55609":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"template--14485356183681__5e0671a2-ee7f-497a-87d2-f75507b55609-1677691461fccaf05c-0":{"type":"image","settings":{"top_subheading":"","title":"GET A CUSTOM LOGO\nON YOUR ENTRANCE MAT","title_size":40,"subheading":"Show off your branding at the doorstep","link":"","link_text":"","link_2":"","link_text_2":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-left","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Custom_Logo_Coco_Mats_2_6a89305a-1933-4e87-bb08-a12ee894f91e.jpg","parallax_direction":"top","overlay_opacity":0,"focal_point":"80% 100%"}},"template--14485356183681__5e0671a2-ee7f-497a-87d2-f75507b55609-1677691461fccaf05c-1":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"top_subheading":"","title":"Two line\ntitle slide.","title_size":80,"subheading":"And big, beautiful imagery","link":"","link_text":"Optional button","link_2":"","link_text_2":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-center horizontal-center","parallax_direction":"top","overlay_opacity":0,"focal_point":"center center"}}},"block_order":["template--14485356183681__5e0671a2-ee7f-497a-87d2-f75507b55609-1677691461fccaf05c-0","template--14485356183681__5e0671a2-ee7f-497a-87d2-f75507b55609-1677691461fccaf05c-1"],"settings":{"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto","parallax":false,"style":"bars","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5}},"74e3d117-b5f3-4080-bb5f-92365b8fc99b":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"Use code BF20 for 20% off custom logo mats","home_featured_products":"black-friday-sale-25-off","per_row":5,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"de26db1e-290e-496b-8f34-d9ac36bc7210":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"For Recessed Wells","title":"DRAINAGE ENTRANCE MATS","text":"<p>Perfect for entrances with a built in recessed well, these mats drain the dirt debris and water under the mat to keep the surface level clear and safe.<\/p><p>Built for heavy duty use, they work best in areas with excessive snow\/rain or just very high level of traffic.<\/p>","button_label":"VIEW ALL RECESSED WELL MATTING","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/recessed-well-mats","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Drainage-Mats_a2cd62b0-a4d9-4db8-800f-fefee2f6d18c.jpg","focal_point":"center","layout":"right","height":650,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"dd4e6143-3779-4b6f-a49a-3cdb1de3a96c":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"Use code BF20 for 20% off rubber mats","home_featured_products":"dura-flex-products","per_row":4,"rows":2,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"92135065-3056-4cb0-9dba-62ef03da2be2":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14485356183681__92135065-3056-4cb0-9dba-62ef03da2be2-1677691934b3f7af8f-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"GOT QUESTIONS?"}},"template--14485356183681__92135065-3056-4cb0-9dba-62ef03da2be2-1677691934b3f7af8f-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Our team of matting experts are ready to help. Contact us today via email at sales@canadamats.ca<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14485356183681__92135065-3056-4cb0-9dba-62ef03da2be2-1677691934b3f7af8f-0","template--14485356183681__92135065-3056-4cb0-9dba-62ef03da2be2-1677691934b3f7af8f-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"77eaa399-e046-443b-82d6-68d1367fae66":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"135b2de8-2b3f-4568-89cb-d619feb09cda":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cadillac_9cc8b4ad-e900-4712-8c5e-3d6e83a943ea.jpg","link":"","width":"33"}},"5c7713f4-c261-4a79-b509-c868b4fef51a":{"type":"ima